  "answer": "Major Tarver becomes accepted by Salome after he proposes to her, which occurs after The Dean returns and gives his consent. The sequence begins with The Dean entering and inviting Major Tarver and Mr. Darbey inside, followed by Salome and Tarver going into the Library together, and later Salome and Tarver standing in the archway, indicating their union.",
